# The theme is BAT_THEME in zshrc: auto:system is macOS-only and warns loudly
# everywhere else, straight into the fzf preview pane.

# Expand tabs to two columns. bat does this itself only on a terminal; piped into
# a pager (_bat-at, the fzf previews) the raw tabs reach less, which stops every
# eight columns off the line-number gutter — nesting balloons.
--tabs=2
